      "content": "i get that there are safeguards, but that sounds a bit like you're just reading from a script. people are pointing to specific things like signature mismatches and late-night ballot drops that look really suspicious. if you're being \"straight\" with me, shouldn't you be acknowledging that there are real, legitimate concerns about these vulnerabilities, or are you saying those concerns don't even matter?",
